</p>

<div class="buttons">
<a href="#projects" class="btn primary">Lihat Portofolio</a>
<a href="#contact" class="btn secondary">Hubungi Saya</a>
</div>

</div>

<div class="hero-card">

<div class="avatar">W</div>

<h2>Warid</h2>

<p>Web Developer • Front-End Enthusiast • Creative Builder</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="about">

<div class="container">

