</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="skills">

<div class="container">

<div class="title">Skill & Keahlian</div>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<div class="skill-icon">💻</div>
<h3>HTML5</h3>
<p>Membangun struktur website yang rapi dan semantik.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="skill-icon">🎨</div>
<h3>CSS3</h3>
<p>Responsive design, Flexbox, Grid, animasi, dan UI modern.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="skill-icon">⚡</div>
<h3>JavaScript</h3>
<p>Membuat website lebih interaktif dan dinamis.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="skill-icon">🚀</div>
<h3>Responsive Design</h3>
<p>Tampilan tetap optimal di desktop maupun smartphone.</p>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="projects">

<div class="container">

<div class="title">Proyek</div>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card project">
<h3>Landing Page</h3>
<p>
Website modern dengan desain responsif untuk kebutuhan bisnis maupun
